 'pad-support':{purpose:'Define and verify the selected tower, support structure or installation rather than treating a symbolic shape as a complete facility.',title:'Pad-support structural and service-interface commissioning',req:'The selected support installation shall meet approved loads, access, utility and vehicle-interface requirements.',approach:'Resolve the provider/site installation definition, review structural/foundation and service routing designs, inspect fabrication and survey interface datums. Demonstrate approved access and moving-service functions where present.',measure:['Resolved installation and as-built survey','Structural / foundation evidence','Access, route and moving-interface clearance','Service / control interface records'],criteria:'Approved structural and interface requirements are closed; unspecified towers, catches or supports receive no invented capability from the model.',sources:['ground-pad','ground-letf','ground-gse']},
