 'lightning-protection':{purpose:'Provide a reviewed strike interception, grounding and transient-protection design around the facility interfaces.',title:'Lightning and grounding design / installation verification',req:'The installed protection system shall meet the approved facility lightning, grounding and transient requirements.',approach:'Review the applicable protection analysis and zone/interface definition, inspect surveyed conductors/electrodes/bonds and verify electrical continuity and protection-system records with approved methods.',measure:['Protection geometry / zone analysis','Bond and ground-system inspection / measurement','Transient-protection and monitoring records'],criteria:'The governing facility design and inspection criteria are closed by the responsible electrical authority. Rendered towers do not establish a protection zone or imply immunity to all strikes.',sources:['ground-lightning','ground-bonding']},
 'commodity-services':{purpose:'Coordinate commodity identity, capacity, containment and vehicle service boundaries without inventing a tank-farm layout.',title:'Commodity-farm system definition and commissioning',req:'The commodity services shall meet the approved quality, delivery and separation requirements for the selected vehicle.',approach:'Resolve each commodity inventory and service ICD, then review storage/distribution design, compatible materials, instrumentation and authorized commissioning records. Verify interface identity and integrated service/control states.',measure:['Commodity / inventory / interface definition','Quality and containment evidence','Delivery and control / monitoring records','Surveyed separation / routing where applicable'],criteria:'Approved commodity and facility requirements are met with selected equipment and authority-controlled records. Current icons assign no vessel count, storage capacity or separation distance.',sources:['ground-fluid-faq','ground-propellants','ground-gas-supply']},
